{"path":"s29","heading":"Decision making by panel of arbitrators.","in_1996":true,"nodes_1996":[{"path":"s29","node_type":"section","number":"29","heading":"Decision making by panel of arbitrators.","text":""},{"path":"s29.ss1","node_type":"subsection","number":"1","heading":null,"text":"Unless otherwise agreed by the parties, in arbitral proceedings with more than one arbitrator, any decision of the arbitral tribunal shall be made by a majority of all its members."},{"path":"s29.ss2","node_type":"subsection","number":"2","heading":null,"text":"Notwithstanding sub-section (1), if authorised by the parties or all the members of the arbitral tribunal, questions of procedure may be decided by the presiding arbitrator."}],"events":[]}